      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 120. Sl st to first ch to form a ring."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 3 (counts as first tr of cluster). Complete the cluster into the first ch. *Ch 1, dc into the next ch, ch 1, work cluster into the next ch*. Repeat around. Ch 1, dc into the last ch, ch 1. Sl st to top of first cluster. (30 clusters.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 2. Work dc into the top of the first cluster. *Ch 1, work cluster into the next dc, ch 1, dc into the top of the next cluster*. Repeat around. Ch 1. Sl st to first dc. (30 clusters, positions shifted by half a repeat.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Rounds 1 and 2 alternately until the cowl measures 30 cm. Fasten off. Weave in ends. Wet block to finished dimensions."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
